From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:01:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: skip the radiotap TLVs in mt76_skb_get_hdr()

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/1a519350810083fce4ae1ab00ff58f02b716f6e0
Fixes: 97d7ab9f51ec ("wifi: mt76: mt7925: add EHT radiotap support in monitor mode")
Fixes: e016239fcb98 ("wifi: mt76: mt7996: Add eht radiotap tlv")
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261117180134.2940930-8-nbd@nbd.name
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mt76.h b/mt76.h
index 4cddfb6..8adbf47 100644
--- a/mt76.h
+++ b/mt76.h
@@ -1487,6 +1487,9 @@ static inline void *mt76_skb_get_hdr(struct sk_buff *skb)
 
 	mstat = *((struct mt76_rx_status *)skb->cb);
 
+	if (mstat.flag & RX_FLAG_RADIOTAP_TLV_AT_END)
+		return skb_mac_header(skb);
+
 	if (mstat.flag & RX_FLAG_RADIOTAP_HE)
 		data += sizeof(struct ieee80211_radiotap_he);
 	if (mstat.flag & RX_FLAG_RADIOTAP_HE_MU)
